DETAIL:  Distributed table public.t is not restricted to one bucket, and shard group 0 does not own every bucket of its colocation group.
HINT:  A session opened by another node runs a statement locally only when every bucket the statement can touch is on this node.
INSERT INTO t VALUES (:tl + 1000, 'a'), (:tr + 1000, 'b');
ERROR:  cannot prove that the statement touches only buckets of this node
DETAIL:  Distributed table public.t is not restricted to one bucket, and shard group 0 does not own every bucket of its colocation group.
HINT:  A session opened by another node runs a statement locally only when every bucket the statement can touch is on this node.
SELECT count(*) FROM t, w WHERE t.id = :tl;
ERROR:  cannot prove that the statement touches only buckets of this node
DETAIL:  Distributed table public.w is not restricted to one bucket, and shard group 0 does not own every bucket of its colocation group.
HINT:  A session opened by another node runs a statement locally only when every bucket the statement can touch is on this node.
SELECT t_count();
ERROR:  cannot prove that the statement touches only buckets of this node
DETAIL:  Distributed table public.t is not restricted to one bucket, and shard group 0 does not own every bucket of its colocation group.
HINT:  A session opened by another node runs a statement locally only when every bucket the statement can touch is on this node.
