ERROR:  cannot prove that the statement touches only buckets of this node
DETAIL:  The planner expanded a SQL-language function that reads distributed table public.t.
HINT:  A session opened by another node runs a statement locally only when every bucket the statement can touch is on this node.
\set VERBOSITY sqlstate
SELECT * FROM t;
ERROR:  KS001
\set VERBOSITY default
SET kingres_shard.forwarded = off;
ERROR:  parameter "kingres_shard.forwarded" cannot be set after connection start
-- A forwarded session of a one-group cluster runs anything: every bucket is
-- local.
UPDATE kingres.bucket_map SET group_id = 0;
DELETE FROM kingres.node WHERE node_id = 2;
SELECT count(*) AS all_rows_local FROM t;
